{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/0e92e6cd739235e865cafd0160f83322.poster.avif?t=1773082439\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/0e92e6cd739235e865cafd0160f83322.webm?t=1773082439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/0e92e6cd739235e865cafd0160f83322.mp4?t=1773082439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/14f7002deacaac65ddbf22584b63398b.avif?t=1773082439\" width=609 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through an ancient world where Eastern mysticism meets dark sci-fi. Embark on a quest to assassinate the King of Annam, who managed to achieve immortality through sinister means.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angered by the King\u2019s act, the Underworld deities have selected a Revenant of forgotten past to be sent back to the mortal realm with one mission: Kill the king who cheated death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/8bd4fd929d879a6ff8348b60bbaea406.poster.avif?t=1773082439\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/8bd4fd929d879a6ff8348b60bbaea406.webm?t=1773082439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/8bd4fd929d879a6ff8348b60bbaea406.mp4?t=1773082439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/83061d346a350a71014ba60cf9df5fed.avif?t=1773082439\" width=609 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Revenant, the player can wield various physical forms across the realms of the dead and the living. Each Revenant form comes with its own set of weapons, skill trees and abilities. They can also unlock unique Talents that suit various playstyles. Find the ideal combinations of Talents and build your ultimate Revenant form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whenever you die, you may resurrect into a different Revenant form. But be warned, your forms are limited resources. If you lose all your forms, you will be banished back to the Underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/084801ca1d2a7bdd6941808187a04157.poster.avif?t=1773082439\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/084801ca1d2a7bdd6941808187a04157.webm?t=1773082439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/084801ca1d2a7bdd6941808187a04157.mp4?t=1773082439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/f9dd2b3db2fbbeaaddc81d7d21c52bce.avif?t=1773082439\" width=609 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in grueling combat with chainable parries, skillful dodges and an original Yin &amp; Yang combo system. Collect a variety of unique weapons, each with its own powerful ability that can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way to the Imperial Palace by defeating formidable foes who are loyal servants of the King. These boss battles will truly test your skills, precise timing and tactical thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/e289018e97cb189105193ca33296d395.poster.avif?t=1773082439\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/e289018e97cb189105193ca33296d395.webm?t=1773082439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/e289018e97cb189105193ca33296d395.mp4?t=1773082439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/211d073b87a578de57d5321d9f401a3e.avif?t=1773082439\" width=609 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Old Capital of Annam filled with mysteries, interconnected areas, hidden paths and deadly elite enemies. Throughout the journey, you will collect multiple weapons, ancient skill texts, rare materials and powerful upgrades to help your Revenant grow ever stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the secret behind the King's immortality and decide the fate of the Old Kingdom. Will you obey the Underworld gods, or choose your own destiny?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3304010?t=1773082439","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/743c6250073d02491d2b916942c619a4cef0006b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773082439","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/cc1cccc489e6ab13281ae13587262085f3c338cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773082439","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/cc1cccc489e6ab13281ae13587262085f3c338cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773082439","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/0e92e6cd739235e865cafd0160f83322.poster.avif?t=1773082439\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/0e92e6cd739235e865cafd0160f83322.webm?t=1773082439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/0e92e6cd739235e865cafd0160f83322.mp4?t=1773082439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/14f7002deacaac65ddbf22584b63398b.avif?t=1773082439\" width=609 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through an ancient world where Eastern mysticism meets dark sci-fi. Embark on a quest to assassinate the King of Annam, who managed to achieve immortality through sinister means.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angered by the King\u2019s act, the Underworld deities have selected a Revenant of forgotten past to be sent back to the mortal realm with one mission: Kill the king who cheated death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/8bd4fd929d879a6ff8348b60bbaea406.poster.avif?t=1773082439\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/8bd4fd929d879a6ff8348b60bbaea406.webm?t=1773082439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/8bd4fd929d879a6ff8348b60bbaea406.mp4?t=1773082439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/83061d346a350a71014ba60cf9df5fed.avif?t=1773082439\" width=609 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Revenant, the player can wield various physical forms across the realms of the dead and the living. Each Revenant form comes with its own set of weapons, skill trees and abilities. They can also unlock unique Talents that suit various playstyles. Find the ideal combinations of Talents and build your ultimate Revenant form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whenever you die, you may resurrect into a different Revenant form. But be warned, your forms are limited resources. If you lose all your forms, you will be banished back to the Underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/084801ca1d2a7bdd6941808187a04157.poster.avif?t=1773082439\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/084801ca1d2a7bdd6941808187a04157.webm?t=1773082439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/084801ca1d2a7bdd6941808187a04157.mp4?t=1773082439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/f9dd2b3db2fbbeaaddc81d7d21c52bce.avif?t=1773082439\" width=609 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in grueling combat with chainable parries, skillful dodges and an original Yin &amp; Yang combo system. Collect a variety of unique weapons, each with its own powerful ability that can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way to the Imperial Palace by defeating formidable foes who are loyal servants of the King. These boss battles will truly test your skills, precise timing and tactical thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/e289018e97cb189105193ca33296d395.poster.avif?t=1773082439\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/e289018e97cb189105193ca33296d395.webm?t=1773082439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/e289018e97cb189105193ca33296d395.mp4?t=1773082439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/extras/211d073b87a578de57d5321d9f401a3e.avif?t=1773082439\" width=609 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Old Capital of Annam filled with mysteries, interconnected areas, hidden paths and deadly elite enemies. Throughout the journey, you will collect multiple weapons, ancient skill texts, rare materials and powerful upgrades to help your Revenant grow ever stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the secret behind the King's immortality and decide the fate of the Old Kingdom. Will you obey the Underworld gods, or choose your own destiny?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Pictagor"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304010/589dd7bbbaf140dd88c31bbdc52e192153c062e7/header.jpg?t=1773082439","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3304010/449809258/8030dec413af265385992c001ecf78aa318ee8c3/1761536010/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761536652","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3304010/449809258/8030dec413af265385992c001ecf78aa318ee8c3/1761536010/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761536652","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3304010/449809258/8030dec413af265385992c001ecf78aa318ee8c3/1761536010/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761536652","id":257066650,"name":"Blackblade Revenant Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257066650/67e2a3c2748a7e42e5a1164c8e071c55ca0c3c63/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761536652"}],"name":"Blackblade Revenant","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows\u00ae 10, Windows\u00ae 11, 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5-8400\u3001AMD Ryzen\u2122 5 3400G<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1650 4GB\u3001Radeon RX 570 4GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Int